# Per-event autorun parameters — Alphabet (GOOGL) Q2 2026, WEDNESDAY 2026-07-22.
# Sourced by scripts/event-autorun.sh via EARSHOT_EVENT_ENV (launchd plist).
# Call: 4:30 PM ET = 2:30 PM CDMX local (pinned 2026-07-17 from abc.xyz IR:
# "Wednesday, July 22, at 1:30pm Pacific (4:30pm Eastern)"). Fire 14:05.
# No pmset wake needed (afternoon, box awake; operator likely attending).
# SAME DAY as GEV (morning) — sequential, not concurrent; per-event state
# dirs isolate them. TO_NUMBER/PASSCODE: TBD — bridge confirmed (Alphabet's
# own transcript, "press *1 on your telephone", configs/dial-ins.toml
# [GOOGL]) but unpublished; Track A: IR ask investor-relations@abc.xyz.
# Preflight FAIL-STOPs while TBD.
EVENT_NAME="GOOGL"
CONFIG_PATH="configs/twilio-live-googl.toml"
TO_NUMBER="TBD"
PASSCODE="TBD"
LABEL="com.earshot.googl-autorun"
